Third-party material
====================

`overwatch-nexon-linux-fix.sh` embeds one certificate:

    Subject : CN = DigiCert Trusted Root G4
              O  = DigiCert Inc, OU = www.digicert.com, C = US
    Issuer  : CN = DigiCert Assured ID Root CA
    SHA-1   : A99D5B79E9F1CDA59CDAB6373169D5353F5874C6
    Valid   : 2022-08-01 .. 2031-11-09

This is a public certificate authority certificate issued and distributed by
DigiCert, Inc. It is the cross-signed form of "DigiCert Trusted Root G4", and
is included so that certificate chain building under Wine reaches the same
root certificate it reaches on Windows.

The certificate is not covered by the MIT license in LICENSE, and no ownership
of it is claimed. It is reproduced verbatim as published by DigiCert. The same
certificate ships inside the Authenticode signature of several widely
distributed binaries and in the certificate stores of current Windows
installations.

